    "When you say \"each order from manufacturer A will include 15 chairs,\" do you mean the number of chairs from A must be a multiple of 15 (i.e., A's chair count is 15 times an integer number of orders), or is 15 just a fixed batch size that applies only once if A is used at all?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single clarification regarding the interpretation of the batch size constraint for manufacturer A, presenting two mutually exclusive options for the same policy."
}

